          "widget": {
            "name": "eb3fca22-efd6-4198-9065-7a7068c06363",
            "textbox_spec": "**NorthPeak Store Operations** | Dana Ruiz, SVP Retail Ops\n\nAn early cold snap \\~3 weeks ago left the same cold-weather styles **SOLD OUT** in the North (red \u2014 lost sales) and **DEAD STOCK** in the South (amber \u2014 markdown clock). This dashboard tracks the exposure and the recovery."
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
